  triggerDays Int?

  /// How far ahead of a dated occasion to send — days before the points expire, before the
  /// tier window closes, before a redemption lapses, before a birthday. Null takes the
  /// occasion's own default.
  leadDays Int?
  /// Hour of the day to send at, 0-23, read in the programme's own `timezone`. Null takes
  /// DEFAULT_SEND_HOUR. The reminder sweep wakes hourly and sends only to programmes whose
  /// chosen hour has just struck locally.
